<div class="flow-box gate"><b>Warden</b><span>pass → 7 checks → audit row</span><span class="refuse">refused calls are never forwarded</span></div>
<span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
<div class="flow-box"><b>Tool servers</b><span>Tickmark · any MCP server</span><span>no public address · 1-minute, one-tool token</span></div>
</div>
<div class="flow-log">append-only audit log · PostgreSQL triggers block UPDATE and DELETE</div>
</figure>
